== Effects ==
* Teleports Isaac to the starting room of the current floor.

== Notes ==
* If the room teleported out of was hostile, it will be reset.
* Previously cleared rooms do not reset.
* {{dlc+|r}} A 0 - The Fool is guaranteed to appear on {{s|Depths}} / {{s|Necropolis}} / {{s|Dank Depths}} II in a [[marked skull]] after unlocking {{a|A Strange Door}}.{{dlc-}}
* When {{curse|Maze}} is active, using this card can teleport Isaac to a random room instead.

== Strategy ==
* 0 - The Fool is the only teleportation card that guarantees a teleportation to a safe room:
** {{p|IX - The Hermit }} may teleport Isaac to a {{e|Greed}} fight.
** {{p|XVII - The Stars}} / {{p|XVIII - The Moon }} may teleport Isaac to a {{r|Treasure Room}} / {{r|Secret Room}} containing enemies.
** {{p|Joker}} may teleport Isaac to a {{r|Devil Room}} with enemies or a {{e|Krampus}} fight.
* 0 - The Fool can be used to escape any room that locks down after taking its contents, like {{r|Challenge Room}}s or {{r|Boss Rush}}, effectively "stealing" its contents without facing the imposed challenge.
* 0 - The Fool can be used to escape any boss fight to recover on the current floor.
* {{dlc+|r}} Using 0 - The Fool during the [[ascent]] can entirely skip a floor, as the light beam is located in the starting room. {{dlc-}}

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Tarot Cloth}} : No effect.

== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|nr}} 0 - The Fool is the only teleportation card available in [[Greed mode]].
* {{dlc|r}} Two other cards are available in greed mode : {{p|XVII - The Stars}} and {{p|Joker}}.
* [[wikipedia:The Fool (tarot card)|The Fool]] is considered a special trump card, being the last or the first of a Major Arcana set, hence the number 0, or no number at all being attributed to it.

